      "claim": "Y contains no information about X when X and Y are independent",
      "supported": true,
      "evidence_or_problem": "Source: [00:04:13\u201300:05:01] - 'this means that y contains no information about x.'"
    },
    {
      "claim": "If Y provides information about X, then P(X|Y) ≠ P(X)",
